WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.410
An ancient Hindu text says
some souls enter wombs,

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.790
and others take immovable
forms, according to their deeds.

3
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.770
Many Hindus believe the
self passes through them,

4
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.600
life after life, in a
cycle called samsara.

5
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.610
And every deliberate act is like a seed.

6
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.180
It will bear fruit,
now or in a later life.

7
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.060
But almost nobody remembers a past life.

8
00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:29.260
So how can you be paying for what
you did in lives you cannot remember?

9
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.360
In this mission, you'll
meet three kinds of karma,

10
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.620
and see what is said to
travel from life to life.

11
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:39.940
Then you'll see why a human
birth is said to matter so much.

12
00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:45.240
Your mission: find out how Hindus explain
paying for lives you cannot remember.
